1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 26]</font>

15
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, I was halfway through packing.</font>

16
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you bring me here?</font>

17
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you're leaving soon, right?</font>

18
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince and I discussed it.</font>

19
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must give you a proper farewell.</font>

20
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:26,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

21
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

22
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place is famous
for its Water Sleeve Dance.</font>

23
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember
that at Father's birthday banquet,</font>

24
00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were utterly captivated.</font>

25
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pay close attention in a moment.</font>

26
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I recall now.</font>

27
00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then, I was thinking</font>

28
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the way those dancers
flicked their sleeves</font>

29
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:51,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was quite unique.</font>

30
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I studied it for a long time.</font>

31
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, that's what you were watching.</font>

32
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it's okay.</font>

33
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The dancers here are also skilled
with their sleeves.</font>

34
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that Jiang Ying?</font>

35
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know Jiang Ying could dance.</font>

36
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're in for a treat.</font>

37
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:39,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This move is called
Breeze Brushing Willows.</font>

38
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tossing a Ball from the Tower.</font>

39
00:02:42,340 --> 00:02:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She hits the drumbeats perfectly.</font>

40
00:02:47,660 --> 00:02:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is she just standing there?</font>

41
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called Casting a Brick
to Attract Jade.</font>

42
00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:54,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stars Surrounding the Moon.</font>

43
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The best part is yet to come.</font>

44
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:06,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was indeed just sleeve-flicking.</font>

45
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This tune is almost over, right?</font>

46
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not right.</font>

47
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not what she told me.</font>

48
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it just dancing?</font>

49
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's so hard about that?</font>

50
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the best at this.</font>

51
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I guarantee</font>

52
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll charm him senseless.</font>

53
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just watch me.</font>

54
00:03:30,780 --> 00:03:32,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, you're so unreliable!</font>

55
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How was my dancing?</font>

56
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to great lengths
to bring my brother here.</font>

57
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:51,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you dance?</font>

58
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean I didn't dance?</font>

59
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I spent a fortune</font>

60
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have them surround me.</font>

61
00:03:56,140 --> 00:03:57,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I danced, it'd look wrong.</font>

62
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't understand.</font>

63
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you just flicked your sleeves a bit?</font>

64
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think
my brother would notice you?</font>

65
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This dance is just the appetizer.</font>

66
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few flicks won't matter.</font>

67
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The main course comes later.</font>

68
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the key to winning him over.</font>

69
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you.</font>

70
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother is leaving very soon.</font>

71
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His luggage is almost packed.</font>

72
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't seize this chance,</font>

73
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there truly won't be a next time.</font>

74
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured, leave it to me.</font>

75
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have my own plan.</font>

76
00:04:31,620 --> 00:04:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will this really work?</font>

77
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to worry about? It's fine.</font>

78
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This third cup.</font>

79
00:04:39,940 --> 00:04:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

80
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">perhaps we should slow down.</font>

81
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some food first.</font>

82
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:48,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin, even on our last day,</font>

83
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't fully enjoy yourself.</font>

84
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll drink alone.</font>

85
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I let you drink alone?</font>

86
00:05:09,380 --> 00:05:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin, you hold your wine well.</font>

87
00:05:11,220 --> 00:05:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about another drink?</font>

88
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise this is the last one.</font>

89
00:05:27,140 --> 00:05:28,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin,</font>

90
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">impressive tolerance.</font>

91
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly impressive.</font>

92
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

93
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you okay?</font>

94
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, your brother is surely not okay.</font>

95
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But rest assured.</font>

96
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take good care of him.</font>

97
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've also had too much today.</font>

98
00:05:58,820 --> 00:05:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We shall take our leave first.</font>

99
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

100
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye then.</font>

101
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Off you go.</font>

102
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:20,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Read more books.</font>

103
00:06:20,780 --> 00:06:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Learn propriety and righteousness.</font>

104
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink less wine.</font>

105
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Avoid idle gossip and trouble.</font>

106
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

107
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must stop drinking.</font>

108
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

109
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No more, no more.</font>

110
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good heavens.</font>

111
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For my own happiness,</font>

112
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll risk it all.</font>

113
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

114
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is there still no news?</font>

115
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wonder how things are going
with Jiang Ying.</font>

116
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:57,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

117
00:06:58,340 --> 00:06:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

118
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the matter?</font>

119
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask your brother.</font>

120
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's...</font>

121
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too shameful to speak of.</font>

122
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My spotless reputation...</font>

123
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I ever marry now?</font>

124
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:17,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

125
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What have you done to my brother?</font>

126
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play along.</font>

127
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or your brother
will have to leave again.</font>

128
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I face my father?</font>

129
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might as well just die.</font>

130
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't stop me!</font>

131
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just let me die!</font>

132
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang.</font>

133
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't find it beneath you,</font>

134
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:41,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm willing to take full responsibility</font>

135
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for what happened last night.</font>

136
00:07:47,460 --> 00:07:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang.</font>

137
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this a refusal?</font>

138
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case, it seems</font>

139
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's only one way left.</font>

140
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, I'm your sister-in-law now.</font>

141
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

142
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

143
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm your sister-in-law now.</font>

144
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

145
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you serious about this?</font>

146
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I spent the night with her.</font>

147
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If word gets out,
her reputation and chastity are ruined.</font>

148
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is</font>

149
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because she wants you to stay.</font>

150
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

151
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want me to stay?</font>

152
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I do.</font>

153
00:08:36,860 --> 00:08:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I know Jiang Ying's character.</font>

154
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's just a sheep in a tiger's skin.</font>

155
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'd never dare cross the line.</font>

156
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been doted on since childhood</font>

157
00:08:47,140 --> 00:08:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has never faced a single setback.</font>

158
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't have feelings for her,</font>

159
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you agree out of a sense of duty,</font>

160
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear she couldn't bear it.</font>

161
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, this morning,</font>

162
00:08:58,820 --> 00:08:59,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I woke up before her.</font>

163
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's so carefree and untroubled,</font>

164
00:09:03,260 --> 00:09:04,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the complete opposite of my nature.</font>

165
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But perhaps that's precisely why</font>

166
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went from envying her freedom</font>

167
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to being unknowingly influenced by her.</font>

168
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All my previous worries and concerns</font>

169
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were simply the fear</font>

170
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that once I indulged,</font>

171
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would be trapped by it.</font>

172
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:21,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet she, a young woman,</font>

173
00:09:21,780 --> 00:09:22,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is willing to risk her reputation</font>

174
00:09:22,900 --> 00:09:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to follow her heart.</font>

175
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I be so timid?</font>

176
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

177
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to be like her</font>

178
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and follow my heart once.</font>

179
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:35,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Jiang Ying</font>

180
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the daughter of Duke Dingguo.</font>

181
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you considered</font>

182
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what you two will face in the future?</font>

183
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where there's a will, there's a way.</font>

184
00:09:43,860 --> 00:09:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our mindset shapes our world.</font>

185
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not everything is preordained.</font>

186
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not challenge the heavens
one more time?</font>

187
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

188
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe you can definitely do it.</font>

189
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:56,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll go make
a marriage proposal another day.</font>

190
00:09:57,740 --> 00:09:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin,</font>

191
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu has returned.</font>

192
00:10:02,780 --> 00:10:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

193
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come with me.</font>

194
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

195
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu has found a way</font>

196
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to suppress the poison within you.</font>

197
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this thing?</font>

198
00:10:21,820 --> 00:10:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness...</font>

199
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

200
00:10:23,700 --> 00:10:25,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is a mysterious black box.</font>

201
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just need to place
your hand inside for a short while.</font>

202
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It will purge most of the poison
from your body.</font>

203
00:10:30,700 --> 00:10:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's right.</font>

204
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

205
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's medicine inside, right?</font>

206
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:36,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could say that.</font>

207
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:39,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you try
putting your hand in first?</font>

208
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:43,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

209
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

210
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

211
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not scared, are you?</font>

212
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:52,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, even you fear something.</font>

213
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would I be afraid of this?</font>

214
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then do it.</font>

215
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

216
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Snake.</font>

217
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:09,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And more than one.</font>

218
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We had no choice.</font>

219
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We feared you'd be unsettled
by the sight.</font>

220
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why we resorted to this.</font>

221
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, it's just snake therapy.</font>

222
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:16,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold still. It will be over soon.</font>

223
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It bit me!</font>

224
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The snake bit me!</font>

225
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go!</font>

226
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help! Someone help!</font>

227
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

228
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me!</font>

229
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't hold him down!</font>

230
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go!</font>

231
00:11:37,620 --> 00:11:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison</font>

232
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">damages the meridians.</font>

233
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This poison</font>

234
00:11:44,020 --> 00:11:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is controlled by an external antidote.</font>

235
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My life</font>

236
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is in someone else's hands,</font>

237
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a golden thread.</font>

238
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There, there.</font>

239
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's alright now.</font>

240
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All done.</font>

241
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The toxin has been expelled
from around his heart.</font>

242
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is out of danger for now.</font>

243
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the next few days,</font>

244
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just make sure he gets plenty of rest,</font>

245
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and there should be no major issues.</font>

246
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's wonderful.</font>

247
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Physician Liu.</font>

248
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:26,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my duty.</font>

249
00:12:41,700 --> 00:12:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

250
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how are you feeling?</font>

251
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel refreshed and clear-headed.</font>

252
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't felt this way in a long time.</font>

253
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:58,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's wonderful.</font>

254
00:12:58,740 --> 00:12:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hard work pays off.</font>

255
00:13:00,540 --> 00:13:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go pour you some tea.</font>

256
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

257
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:11,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are you thinking about?</font>

258
00:13:15,180 --> 00:13:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

259
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:17,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to tell you both.</font>

260
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't share the same father?</font>

261
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father treated me as his own.</font>

262
00:13:23,100 --> 00:13:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I meant to bury this in my heart.</font>

263
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But seeing that just now,</font>

264
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suddenly remembered Grandfather.</font>

265
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:30,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His life</font>

266
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is tied to your happiness, after all.</font>

267
00:13:32,300 --> 00:13:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

268
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never meant to hide it from you.</font>

269
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the past stay in the past.</font>

270
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were young,</font>

271
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always felt Father favored you.</font>

272
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I even got angry with you many times.</font>

273
00:13:43,140 --> 00:13:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are my sister.</font>

274
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I hold that against you?</font>

275
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

276
00:13:48,820 --> 00:13:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone used to say</font>

277
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that our family was Xizhao spies</font>

278
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that we poisoned your family.</font>

279
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But my grandfather</font>

280
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">died from that very poison.</font>

281
00:13:58,060 --> 00:13:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think my mother</font>

282
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would have used the same method</font>

283
00:14:00,220 --> 00:14:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on someone else?</font>

284
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

285
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you said the poison is controlled</font>

286
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:06,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by an external antidote.</font>

287
00:14:06,140 --> 00:14:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does that mean?</font>

288
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The reason the Prince is still well now.</font>

289
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it mean</font>

290
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the antidote controlling his condition</font>

291
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still exists?</font>

292
00:14:16,580 --> 00:14:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In other words,</font>

293
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his life right now</font>

294
00:14:19,260 --> 00:14:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is in someone else's hands.</font>

295
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

296
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what else do you know about this poison?</font>

297
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison</font>

298
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a rare poison of Xizhao.</font>

299
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps,</font>

300
00:14:30,820 --> 00:14:31,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to find the antidote,</font>

301
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the only way is to go to Xizhao</font>

302
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and trace it back to its source.</font>

303
00:14:34,820 --> 00:14:36,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They hold my life in their hands,</font>

304
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet they don't kill me.</font>

305
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who exactly are they?</font>

306
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:50,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

307
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is here.</font>

308
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo.</font>

309
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

310
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not about Jiang Ying, is it?</font>

311
00:14:58,220 --> 00:14:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo dotes on his daughter.</font>

312
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's bound to be hostile.</font>

313
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should hide for now.</font>

314
00:15:03,220 --> 00:15:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle him.</font>

315
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

316
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo demands to see Mr. Qin.</font>

317
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

318
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do we do?</font>

319
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go.</font>

320
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hiding won't solve anything.</font>

321
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must face this.</font>

322
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke, please forgive me</font>

323
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for not greeting you properly.</font>

324
00:15:25,780 --> 00:15:27,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sudden visit</font>

325
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:29,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is for a matter of great importance.</font>

326
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here to see Mr. Qin.</font>

327
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Qin,</font>

328
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty has sent me</font>

329
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to request your presence.</font>

330
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Years ago, Mrs. Qin</font>

331
00:15:55,380 --> 00:15:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the Emperor of Xizhao</font>

332
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shared a brief romantic encounter</font>

333
00:15:58,420 --> 00:16:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">back when he was still a prince.</font>

334
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, when she learned</font>

335
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Prince was named Crown Prince,</font>

336
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the Xizhao Emperor had chosen
a Crown Princess,</font>

337
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she secretly gave birth to you.</font>

338
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many years passed,</font>

339
00:16:15,420 --> 00:16:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and after your grandfather passed away,</font>

340
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the family's fortunes declined.</font>

341
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She went to the borderlands</font>

342
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and came to know</font>

343
00:16:21,260 --> 00:16:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beiyuan's Governor Qin Minzhi.</font>

344
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:26,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My birth father was the Xizhao Emperor?</font>

345
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you come to know this?</font>

346
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To save his own skin,</font>

347
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fuhai sold this information.</font>

348
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He also confessed</font>

349
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Princess Changle</font>

350
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had an old flame in Xizhao,</font>

351
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who happened to know Mrs. Qin's family.</font>

352
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle covertly substituted</font>

353
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and rescued you back then.</font>

354
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:47,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid</font>

355
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she had ulterior motives.</font>

356
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

357
00:16:56,750 --> 00:16:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

358
00:16:58,420 --> 00:17:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

359
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:06,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

360
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
